flowchart LR
	EXEC["the write executor originally mapped the caller's<br/>abort signal onto the run promise's options"]
	PRE["a pre-aborted signal<br/>interrupts the whole fiber"]
	SEEN["the caller sees all fibers interrupted<br/>without error"]
	EXPECT["instead of the Classic<br/>aborted-before-write behavior"]
	FIX["the fix - the signal mapping dropped"]
	SEAMS["the signal forwards to the seams only"]
	EXEC --> PRE --> SEEN
	SEEN -. "not" .-> EXPECT
	EXEC -. "fixes" .-> FIX --> SEAMS
